## 🇬🇧 English Version

### Introduction

Welcome to **Grammaire Française & Exercice** – your comprehensive app for learning French grammar and practicing it through interactive lessons and diverse exercises.

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it. This policy explains how we handle your data when you use the app.

---

### 1. Data We Collect

#### a. Data NOT Collected (Offline-First App)

- We do not collect any personal data (name, email, phone).
- No data is sent to external servers.
- No account creation is required.

#### b. Local Data (On Your Device Only)

- **Learning Progress:** Your progress in lessons and exercises (completed lessons, scores, mastery levels) is saved locally on your device only.
- **Settings:** Your preferences (language, theme, notifications) are stored locally.
- **Exercise Data:** Your answers in quizzes and exercises are saved locally to track your progress.

---

### 2. Permissions Used

| Permission        | Reason                                                                   |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Storage**       | To save learning progress, audio files, and pre-loaded content           |
| **Internet**      | To download additional content (extended lessons, audio files) on demand |
| **Notifications** | To remind you of daily review sessions (can be disabled in Settings)     |

> **Note:** The app does NOT request Camera, Contacts, or Location permissions.

---

### 3. Educational Content & Lessons

The app includes:

- **French Grammar Lessons** (verbs, tenses, pronouns, articles...)
- **Interactive Exercises** (multiple choice, fill-in-the-blank, true/false, flashcards)
- **Audio Files** for correct pronunciation and listening
- **Assessment Quizzes** to measure mastery level

All materials are protected by intellectual property rights. They are permitted for personal educational use only.

---

### 4. Advertisements

- The app may display ads to support continued delivery of free content.
- Ad networks (such as Google AdMob) may use device identifiers to show relevant ads.
- Please refer to [Google's Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy) for details on data handling.

---

### 5. Children's Privacy

- The app is suitable for all ages, including children.
- We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13 years of age.
- All educational content is safe and reviewed to be appropriate for learners of all ages.

---

### 6. Data Security

- All data saved on your device is encrypted and protected by your device's security system.
- Your data is never shared with third parties.

---

### 7. Your Rights

- **Delete Data:** You may delete all your data by uninstalling the app.
- **Disable Notifications:** From within the app's settings or your device's system settings.

---

### 8. Contact Us

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy:

- **Email:** [funeasylearn101@gmail.com]

